  WrittenDialogue: "I’m so glad we blew off that audition. The night life is what modeling’s really about.\nThese clubs are like my house parties but so much better!\nEvery guy’s rich, any drug you could ever want, and best of all if someone dies it’s the club’s problem and not yours!\nInside joke- Not like that drowning was our fault anyway.\nFuck that guy! Let’s have a night we’ll never forget!\nCan somebody buy me a drink??"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "KELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY\nKELLY"
